  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://files.waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85/ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85-Demo.zip). SD D3/CS: the schematic's pin table and the wiki put it on Extend_IO3 (TCA9554 P2), but the Arduino demo's SD_Card.cpp toggles EXIO_PIN4 (P3, which the schematic gives to IMU_INT2).",
